1
00:00:00,959 --> 00:00:02,961
It was really hard
to book this cake

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:05,213
Thank you

3
00:00:05,547 --> 00:00:06,266
I really wanted

4
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:07,925
my end the year
to be like this

5
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,760
Christmas with you
Hyesung

6
00:00:11,803 --> 00:00:13,180
It's a huge success, huh?

7
00:00:16,808 --> 00:00:20,187
But why didn't you
tell her earlier?

8
00:00:20,604 --> 00:00:21,604
What?

9
00:00:21,897 --> 00:00:23,023
Am I not your lover?

10
00:00:23,232 --> 00:00:23,815
Ah, that's…

11
00:00:23,941 --> 00:00:25,526
How did you save my name
in your phone?

12
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:26,276
Well…

13
00:00:26,401 --> 00:00:28,529
Don't tell me
it's just "Shin Yoo-il"

14
00:00:28,946 --> 00:00:30,868
Hey, it's Christmas

15
00:00:30,952 --> 00:00:32,491
Why don't we
put some candles?

16
00:00:35,535 --> 00:00:37,037
Let's put them here

17
00:00:37,371 --> 00:00:38,371
and make a wish

18
00:00:39,915 --> 00:00:40,915
I have no wish

19
00:00:43,043 --> 00:00:44,187
I shouldn't wish more
than this

20
00:00:44,211 --> 00:00:46,004
Come on, make a wish

21
00:00:47,714 --> 00:00:48,590
What about you?

22
00:00:48,674 --> 00:00:49,758
The wish is
supposed to be…

23
00:00:50,801 --> 00:00:51,969
a secret

24
00:01:06,525 --> 00:01:07,526
It's a Christmas gift

25
00:01:12,406 --> 00:01:13,406
Oh no

26
00:01:14,449 --> 00:01:16,326
I didn't prepare
anything

27
00:01:19,246 --> 00:01:20,246
So

28
00:01:20,539 --> 00:01:22,708
aren't you gonna tell me
what wish you made?

29
00:01:27,045 --> 00:01:28,380
I just wished
my next year

30
00:01:30,132 --> 00:01:31,633
to be as happy as now

31
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:33,468
with you
